c unescape); `testUnescapeNoStrict`: "Hello &lt World" -> "Hello < World" (checks unescape without strict semicolon); `testUnescapeStrict`: "Hello &lt" -> "Hello &lt" (checks strict unescape with missing semicolon); `testUnescapeMultiple`: "Quotes &quot; and &apos;" -> "Quotes \" and '" (checks unescape of multiple entities); `testUnescapeNumericHex`: "&#x20AC;" -> "€" (checks hex numeric unescape); `testUnescapeNumericDecimal`: "&#8364;" -> "€" (checks decimal numeric unescape); `testUnescapeWithInvalidNamedEntity`: "Invalid &invalid;" -> "Invalid &invalid;" (checks invalid named entity); `testUnescapeWithNumericHexTruncated`: "&#x" -> "&#x" (checks truncated hex numeric entity); `testUnescapeWithNumericDecimalTruncated`: "&#" -> "&#" (checks truncated decimal numeric entity); `testUnescapeWithPartialNumeric`: "Test&#" -> "Test&#" (checks partial numeric entity); `testGetMapXhtml`: checks specific entries in xhtml map; `testGetMapBase`: checks specific entries in base map; `testGetMapExtended`: checks specific entries in extended map; `testEscapeModeEnumBaseDirect`: checks base mode direct escape; `testEscapeModeEnumExtendedDirect`: checks extended mode direct escape; `testEscapeModeEnumXhtmlDirect`: checks xhtml mode direct escape for nbsp.
